 560\n\nYou are welcome to join our International Spouse Coffee anytime fro
 m 10:30 a.m. to noon enjoying coffee\, cookies & great conversations.\n\nT
 he Coffee events are ideal opportunities to make new friends & learn more 
 about Bechtel’s programs\, classes & workshops\, the Stanford campus\, a
 nd helpful resources in the nearby communities. No registration is require
 d - just stop by! Every Wednesday from 10:30 a.m. to 12:00 p.m. at the Bec
 htel International Center\, Assembly room. \n\nJoin us for our Special Int
 ernational Spouse Coffee events: Welcome Coffee - September 23\, Mid Autum
 n festival - October 14\, 2026 \, Diwali -  November 11\, 2026 and Interna
 tional Volunteer Day - December 9\, 2026\,  10:30 AM - 12:00 PM at the Ass
 embly room\, Bechtel International Center.
